'''Li'l Cat's Trial''' (ちびネコ大試練, ''Chibi Neko Dai Shiren'', '''Li'l Cat Trials''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] and appears every 3 days each month, starting on the 2nd and going up to the 26th. It is unlocked after clearing all nine [[:Category:Li'l Stages|Li'l Cat Awakens]] stages. Each stage cleared will increase the Li'l Cat unit + caps by five levels.

